  "metadata_synthesis": "Movie. 2016. Dark superhero epic. Highly divisive blockbuster.",
  "setting_and_subculture": "Grim twin metropolises. Rainy, crime-ridden alleyways. Brutalist architecture. Ruined financial districts. High-society galas. Corporate media spin. Godlike aliens put on political trial.",
  "visual_tone_and_feel": "Heavily desaturated colors. Constant driving rain. Deep, crushing shadows. Slow-motion visual opera. Chiaroscuro lighting. CGI-heavy destruction. Metallic, muddy blues and grays.",
  "media_era_tone": "Mid-2010s cinematic universe arms race. Edgy and aggressively self-serious. Deconstructive comic book adaptation. Massive budget spectacle. Thunderous, brooding musical score.",
  "pacing_and_structure": "Ponderous, methodical build-up. Tangential apocalyptic dream sequences. Convoluted corporate espionage. Heavy philosophical posturing. Explosive, numbing third-act monster brawl.",
  "atmosphere_and_mood": "Bleak. Cynical. Oppressive. Operatic. Angry. Drenched in heavy-handed religious allegory and grim machismo.",
  "themes_and_messages": "Accountability of living gods. Xenophobia and unchecked paranoia. The corruption of absolute power. Moral absolutism versus bloody pragmatism. Weaponized fear. Shared maternal connection.",
  "character_relationships": "Almighty pissing contest between titans. Paranoid veteran vigilante versus alienated alien god. Manipulative, twitchy tech-bro instigating chaos. Exhausted immortal warrior stepping in to fix their mess.",
  "lead_character_type": "Murderous, deeply cynical billionaire bat. Brooding, misunderstood alien god. Manic, neurotic corporate mastermind. Regal, exasperated ancient amazon.",
  "story_and_plot_type": "Manufactured gladiator match. Corporate manipulation and framing. Superhero deconstruction. Apocalyptic doomsday fight.",
  "who_and_when": "Present day. Broken vigilantes. Extraterrestrial messiahs. Unhinged tech executives. Bureaucratic government senators.",
  "emotional_evocation": "Frustration. Awe. Sensory exhaustion. Intense, overwhelming bombast. Pockets of sheer mythical grandeur."
